# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sensitive / un-redactable artifacts — NEVER commit these.
#
# The lab ran on a real network. Raw Wazuh output, dashboard exports, terminal
# recordings and report PDFs all embed live internal IPs and hostnames, and the
# ones baked into images cannot be redacted by find-and-replace. Anything
# published in this repo is hand-sanitized first; the raw sources stay local.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Raw Wazuh manager output (real srcip / agent.ip / manager hostname)
alerts.json
alerts*.json
!evidence/alerts-sample.json     # the hand-sanitized excerpt is allowed
archives*.json
ossec.log
*.log

# Dashboard exports — spreadsheet rows carry live IPs
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv

# Terminal recordings / screencasts — shell prompts and IPs on every frame
*.mp4
*.mov
*.m4v
*.webm

# Report / submission documents (embedded screenshots with IPs, personal details)
*.pdf
*.docx
*.pptx

# Screenshots must be redacted by hand before being un-ignored individually
screenshots/*.png
screenshots/*.jpg
screenshots/*.jpeg
!screenshots/.gitkeep

# Credentials & key material
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
known_hosts
authorized_keys
passwords.txt

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
